    "keyboard": {
      "disclaimer": "The corpus is written in the Cyrillic alphabet, so make sure every letter you type is Cyrillic. For example, \"тој\" with the Cyrillic ј and \"тоj\" with a Latin j look the same, but to the computer they are two different words. The search fixes such mixed words for you, but a word typed fully in Latin letters finds nothing. Use the keyboard to find the right letters."
